<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>The room closed in around Sarah. The garden clouded over. She blinked tears away.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Hayley quietly slid off the sofa and sat on the floor with her legs curled under the coffee table, gathered a throw pillow to her chest and draped an arm draped over the sofa\'92s seat cushion. \'91Sarah?\'92\
