<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah saw the accusations in Kathy\'92s eyes, and felt fibres in her own heart rending. \'91I\'92m sorry \'85 I \'85 it\'92s such a vile thing, I decided I must keep it from \'85 everyone.\'92 And yet she\'92d surrendered it so easily to Eloise. Eloise set her jaw and resolved to correct that.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Vile?\'92 Kathy asked and searched Sarah\'92s face. She read the distress in her eyes and the tension in her neck. \'91Sarah, what did it do to you?\'92\
